  title="Static website hosting: how to deploy an Astro, Vite or plain HTML site"
  description="What static hosting is, how a CDN serves your build, and how to deploy an Astro, Vite or JAMstack site with a custom domain and free HTTPS."
  cat="hosting"
  updated="2026-11-20"
  day={12}
  hero="/img/static-website-hosting-hero.jpg"
  heroAlt="A technician's hand servicing a blue-lit server in a data center rack"
